    "es": "Esto es una historia verdaderamente real, pero ella no sabe que la he puesto en un cómic porque su wifi no funciona desde hace semanas.",
    "en": "This really is a true story, and she doesn't know I put it in my comic because her wifi hasn't worked for weeks.",
    "noteEn": "The narrator says the events really happened and jokes that the woman has not discovered the comic because her wireless connection has been down for weeks."
  },
